    {
      "characteristic": "fair with harmful bias managed",
      "justification": "The assistant answers product questions and makes no decisions about individuals; no lab in the evidence base measures fairness across customer groups. Excluded for this release, and recorded as residual risk R6 so the exclusion has an owner and an expiry."
    }
  ],
